9. Nc2 ( 9. Na3 ) ) ) ( 7... b6 ) ( 7... Bb6 ) ( 7... Qg6 $2
{ The queen hits e4 and g2, but it stops guarding the knight on c6. [Nxc6] uncovers the bishop on e3 against c5, and after [Nxc6 Qxc6 Qh5], White's queen attacks f7 and c5 at once. Black loses the pawn on f7 and the right to castle. Keep the queen on f6 until the knights are settled. Before you move a piece that defends something, check every piece it was protecting. }
