( 7. Qe2 $2
{ Blocking with the queen offers a trade while a pawn down. After [Qxe2+ Bxe2 Kd8], the king covers c7, the queens are gone, and so is White's attack. Black keeps the extra pawn in a calm endgame. When you have given a pawn for the initiative, keep the queens. }
