{ Snatching the g5-pawn looks tempting, yet it is poisoned: [Qf5] forks White's rook on e4 and bishop on g5, and [Rg4] cannot save them because Black's bishop back on c8 guards g4, leaving Black a piece up after [Qf5 Qe2 Qxg5]. Play [w:Qf1] instead. [%csl Re4,Rg5][%cal Gh3f5] }
16... Qf5 17. Qe2 Qxg5 ) ) ( 15. Qe2 ) ( 15. Nd2 $2
