{ Played in over forty percent of club games, [w:Nxd5] hands Black an ideal position: [Qxd5] plants Black's queen in the middle with no knight left to kick her, pins White's f3 knight along the long diagonal, and hits it with [Qxd5 Bg2 e4]. Play [w:Bg2] so Black has to make the concession. [%csl Rf3][%cal Gd8d5] }
