{ The Bongcloud Attack, chess's famous internet joke opening (seen at top level when Magnus Carlsen and Hikaru Nakamura played [b:Ke7], the Double Bongcloud, to a quick draw in 2021). Objectively stepping to e2 is a serious self-inflicted handicap: White forfeits castling, blocks both d1 and f1, and leaves the king in the center. Open lines quickly with [Nf6] and [d5]. [%csl Ge2,Gd1,Gf1][%cal Gg8f6] }
