{ Moving the knight to d6 walks into the exact same discovered-check catastrophe: [Nc6+ Be7 Nxd8] checks Black's king with the queen on e2 while the knight snatches the undefended queen on d8. Only [Qe7] keeps Black in the game. [%csl Rd6,Re2][%cal Ge5c6] }
