{ Jumping to g5 still uncovers the open e-file against Black's king on e8, so [Nc6+ Ne6 Nxd8] wins Black's queen on d8 by discovered check. Never move the knight off e4 here; counter-pin with [Qe7]. [%csl Rg5,Re8][%cal Ge5c6] }
