( 5. Nf3 $6
{ Retreating the knight hands away White's entire initiative and lets Black consolidate a comfortable extra tempo with [d5 d3 Nf6], since White's queen on e2 blocks the f1 bishop. Take the knight on e4 with [Qxe4]. [%csl Re2,Re4][%cal Gd7d5] }
