{ White reinforces e5 and opens lines for rapid development. Black must now capture the pinned knight with [dxe5], entering the main Kholmov Gambit tabiya a pawn down in return for quick queenside mobilization with [Nc6], [Bd7] and [b:O-O-O] before White's king has castled. Trying to get greedy with [f6] backfires badly. Black's compensation rests entirely on fast queenside castling and pressure down the d- and e-files before White's king finds shelter. [%csl Ye5][%cal Gd6e5] }
( 6. Qa4+ $2
