{ The Stafford Gambit Accepted. Black is a full central pawn down with doubled c-pawns, yet every piece has open lanes toward e4, g4 and f2. White's golden rules are to protect e4, control g4 before Black lands [Ng4] alongside [Bc5], and delay castling into an h-file storm. [d3] (followed by [Be2] and [c3]), [Nc3] (followed by [h3]), [f3] and [Qe2] all refute the gambit cleanly, while [e5] is sharp. [%csl Ye4,Yg4,Yf2][%cal Gd2d3] }
