{ Defending e4 with [Nc3] renews White's threat of [dxe5] followed by trading queens on d8 to win the e5-pawn. Black now reaches the Improved Hanham, or Black Lion, with [Nbd7], holding e5 firmly without having allowed White's fourth-move f7 traps, or trades into the main Exchange Philidor via [exd4]. Careless bishop moves that ignore e5 drop a pawn immediately. [%csl Ye4,Yd8,Ye5][%cal Gb8d7] }
