{ The Copycat variation is one of the highest-scoring club weapons in the Vienna: Black's g7-pawn hangs while the f8-bishop has already left home. Only two moves hold: [g6] (weakening f6 and h6 around a future castled king) and [Kf8] (forfeiting castling to guard g7). The natural club reflex [Qf6] loses to [Qf6 Nd5], while [Nf6 Qxg7] and [d5 Qxg7] drop the kingside. [%csl Gf6,Gh6,Gg7][%cal Gg7g6] }
