{ In the Copycat Trap, [Nd5] attacks Black's queen on f6 and threatens [w:Nxc7+] to win the corner rook on a8. Black has nothing better left than playing the intended check [Qxf2+] ([Kd1]), hoping to complicate the game. Backing down with [Qg6 Qxg6 hxg6 Nxc7+] drops a clean rook, and [Bxf2+ Kf1] hangs the queen or rook as well. Once [Qxf2+ Kd1] lands, White threatens both [w:Qxg7] (winning the h8-rook) and [w:Nxc7+] (winning the a8-rook), forcing Black into [b:Kf8]. [%csl Gf6,Ga8][%cal Gf6f2] }
