{ Defending e5 with [Nc6] walks into [fxe5 Nxe5 d4 Ng6 e5 Ng8 Nf3], chasing BOTH Black knights off the board while White owns the entire centre. Play [d5]. [%csl Re5][%cal Rf4e5] }
