{ Pinning c3 drops the centre and dark squares to [fxe5 Bxc3 dxc3 Nxe4 Qg4], attacking both the loose knight on e4 and g7 with a winning lead in activity. Strike in the centre with [d5]. [%csl Rc3,Re4,Rg7][%cal Rf4e5] }
