{ Black preserves the h-file pin from h5 and threatens [b:Nxh1]. Instead of saving the rook passively with [Rg1 Nxf1], White strikes in the centre with [Nxd5]: the knight threatens [w:Nxc7+] to win Black's corner rook on a8 with check, and sets the famous Würzburger geometry trap if Black tries to guard c7 with [b:Na6]. [%csl Gh5,Ga8,Gc7][%cal Gc3d5] }
