6. bxc3
{ Recapturing towards the centre with [bxc3] builds a compact pawn mass ready to support [w:d4], [w:Bd3] and a kingside attack down the half-open f-file. Black's sharpest counter is immediate [c5] (before [Be7]), stopping [d4] because Black's queen still has access to h4; developing [Be7] ([d4 c5]) is the solid classical main line. [%csl Gh4][%cal Gf8e7] }
( 6. dxc3
