{ The pawn guards e5 but leaves c5 loose. [dxc5] takes it, and after [dxc5 Qa5+ Nc3 Qxc5 Be3] White gains time on the queen. [b:cxd4] was the move. [%csl Rc5][%cal Gd4c5] }
