{ White has castled. Black should develop the bishop, [Bc5] or [Bd6], or play [Nge7], keeping f6 free for now: a knight there is kicked by [e5], which is why Morra players wait for it to come. With [Bd6] or [Nge7], Black covers e5, keeps the kingside intact and is ready to castle next. [%csl Ye5][%cal Gf8c5,Gf8d6,Gg8e7] }
