{ The Siberian Trap. [Nd4] hits the queen on e2, and the knight on f3 can't take it: [Nd4 Nxd4 Qh2#] is mate, because the knight was the only guard of h2. After [Nd4 hxg4 Nxe2+] the queen is lost anyway. Before you kick a knight, check what the other one can do. [%csl Re2,Rh2][%cal Gc6d4] }
