{ Combining [g6] with an earlier [e6] against the Smith-Morra creates Swiss-cheese dark squares on d6 and f6 right when White is ahead in development! After [O-O a6 Bf4 Bg7 Bb3], [w:Bd6] threatens to paralyze Black's king in the centre and block the d-pawn permanently. Stick to [b:a6], [b:Qc7] or [b:Nf6] instead. [%csl Yg6][%cal Re1g1] }
7. O-O a6 8. Bf4 Bg7 9. Bb3 ) 7. O-O
