{ The b-pawn chases the bishop, but it goes to d5, hitting the knight and the rook on a8. After [Bd5 Bb7 Nd4], White wins material on c6. Play [b:e6] first. [%csl Rc6,Ra8][%cal Gc4d5] }
8. Bd5 ) ) ( 6... Nf6 7. e5
