{ Black grabs the centre while the queen still sits on d5, handing White a free developing move. [Nc3] attacks the queen, and wherever she retreats White follows with d4 or Bc4 and O-O: the pawn on e5 becomes a target and the e-file opens toward Black's king. Develop with ...Nf6 or ...Bg4 first. [%csl Yd5,Yd4,Ye5][%cal Rb1c3] }
