{ The Patzer variation: Black checks, but the queen will be hit again. [Be2] blocks with a developing move; White follows with Nf3 and d4, gaining more tempi on the queen. [Nge2] blocks with the knight, which will come to g3 or f4, and d4 follows. Blocking with the queen offers a trade and gives most of White's lead away. The engine gives White a clear edge after the two developing blocks, though the line is playable. [%csl Yc6,Yd4][%cal Gf1e2] }
4. Be2
