{ The Slav through the knight move order. [Nf3] returns to the main lines of the Slav and the Semi-Slav. [e3] shuts in the bishop on c1, and Black answers with [b:e6], [b:Bf5] or [b:a6]. [w:Bg5] pins the knight, and Black can take on c4 or jump [b:Ne4] to hit the bishop and the knight. [cxd5] [b:cxd5] gives an Exchange Slav. Black aims to bring the bishop on c8 out once b7 and d5 are safe. [%csl Rc1][%cal Gg1f3,Ge2e3,Bc4d5] }
