{ The Grünfeld Variation of the Torre Attack: rather than blocking the c8 bishop with [e6], Black fianchettoes on the kingside with [g6] and [b:Bg7], preparing [b:O-O] and [b:c5] while keeping every piece active. White's main plan builds the sturdy Torre pyramid with [e3] and [Nbd2] followed by [w:c3] and [w:Bd3] (or [w:Be2]), blunting g7 along the long diagonal. Trading early with [Bxf6 exf6] inflicts doubled f-pawns at the cost of surrendering the bishop pair, while [c4] transposes into Grünfeld territory. [%cal Gf8g7,Ge2e3,Gb1d2] }
