{ The main Catalan position before castling, reached from both the Indian move order and the Queen's Gambit Declined. Black almost always castles short with [O-O], waiting until White castles before choosing between [b:dxc4] in the Classical Open Catalan and [b:c6] in the Closed Catalan. Taking [dxc4] right away reaches the Classical Open a move early, while [c6] commits immediately to the Closed pawn triangle. [%cal Ge8g8] }
