( 5... dxc4 ) ( 5... c6 ) 6. O-O
{ The main tabiya of the Catalan Opening, contested in World Championship matches by Kramnik, Topalov, Anand, Carlsen and Nepomniachtchi. Both kings are castled, and Black chooses the strategic landscape: [dxc4] opens the game in the Classical Open Catalan, [c6] erects the solid Semi-Slav triangle of the Closed Catalan, and [Nbd7] keeps the c-pawn flexible (while [b6] transposes to the Queen's Indian and [c5] to the Tarrasch). [%cal Gd5c4] }
