{ The main tabiya of the Exchange Grünfeld. The strategic battle lines are crystal clear: White wants to consolidate the mighty d4-e4 pawn center, push [w:d5] at the right moment or launch a kingside attack, while Black attacks d4 with [b:c5], [b:Nc6], [b:Qa5], [b:O-O], [b:Rd8] and [b:Bg4], banking on the monster g7-bishop and the 2-vs-1 queenside majority for the endgame. White chooses between [Nf3] (Modern), [Bc4] (Classical), [Be3] (Karpov) and [Bb5+]. [%csl Yd4,Yc4][%cal Gc7c5] }
