{ The Medusa Gambit throws away a kingside flank pawn for zero compensation: [Bxg5 Ne4 Bf4] keeps the extra pawn safely while Black's kingside stays permanently drafty (White should capture [w:Bxg5] immediately rather than ignoring it). Develop with [b:e6], [b:g6] or [b:c5] instead. [%cal Gc1g5,Yc1f4] }
