{ With the f8 bishop threatening b4, White pushes [b5] with tempo on Black's queenside, seizing space and denying Black's knight its natural c6 post. Black strikes straight back in the center with [d5] (aiming for [d5 e3 Bd6] and [b:c5] or [b:Nbd7]), undermines the advanced spearhead immediately with [a6] ([a6 a4 axb5 axb5] opening the a-file), or prepares a light-squared counter-fianchetto with [b6] and [b:Bb7]. [%csl Yc6][%cal Gd7d5,Ba7a6,Yb7b6] }
